      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    cost = 120000\n    salvage_value = 20000\n    useful_life = 5\n    year = 3\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    depreciable_amount = cost - salvage_value\n    sum_of_years = useful_life * (useful_life + 1) // 2\n    remaining_years = useful_life - year + 1\n    depreciation_expense = depreciable_amount * remaining_years / sum_of_years\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(depreciation_expense)\n```",
